---
const rawBase = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = rawBase.endsWith("/") ? rawBase : `${rawBase}/`;
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="title">대양특장 주식회사</div>
      <div class="desc">분뇨차·유조차 부품 및 탱크 부품 공급</div>
    </div>

    <section
      class="contact-hero"
      aria-label="상담 안내"
      style={`background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(14, 57, 143, 0.93) 0%, rgba(14, 57, 143, 0.75) 35%, rgba(14, 57, 143, 0.42) 60%, rgba(14, 57, 143, 0.2) 100%),
      url('${base}footer.jpg')`}
    >
      <div class="overlay">
        <h3>대양특장 주식회사는 언제나 최상의<br />부품과 안정적인 공급을 약속합니다</h3>

        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="cta phone" href="tel:031-858-2277">
            <span class="ico">☎</span>
            <span>전화 상담</span>
          </a>

          <a class="cta email" href="mailto:daeyangsss@kakao.com">
            <span class="ico">✉</span>
            <span>이메일 문의</span>
          </a>

          <a class="cta kakao" href="https://pf.kakao.com/_bjkAX/chat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="talk">TALK</span>
            <span>카카오톡 상담</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="address">
      <div class="head">주소</div>
      <div class="item">경기도 양주시 남면 은남로 76-4</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container bottom">
    <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 대양특장 주식회사. All rights reserved.</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; }
.inner { padding: 24px 16px; }
.brand .title { font-weight: 900; }
.brand .desc { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

.contact-hero {
  margin-top: 18px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 550px;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 5;
  border-radius: 18px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
}

.overlay {
  height: 100%;
  padding: 18px 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-start;
}

.contact-hero h3 {
  margin: 0;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 26px);
  line-height: 1.32;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
}

.cta-row {
  margin-top: 14px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 14px;
}

.cta {
  min-height: 48px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 0 8px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(14px, 1.1vw, 19px);
  font-weight: 800;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.ico {
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.1vw, 22px);
  line-height: 1;
}

.cta.phone {
  color: #fff;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1458cb 0%, #0d3e9b 100%);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
}

.cta.email {
  color: #4e5566;
  background: #f4f5f7;
  border-color: #d1d5db;
}

.cta.kakao {
  color: #3a2a14;
  background: #f7c608;
  border-color: #efbe06;
}

.talk {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #43291d;
  color: #f7c608;
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.address { margin-top: 16px; }
.head { font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.item { color: var(--muted); margin: 4px 0; }
.bottom { padding: 14px 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-hero { max-width: 100%; }
  .overlay { padding: 14px 12px; }
  .cta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cta { min-height: 44px; }
}
</style>
